  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-12-04T19:15:42.108Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Lots of functions on my avatar depend on my trigger weight but unfortunately when I am not touching the trigger at all the full weight is at 1,  Meaning even when I'm not touching my trigger all of the effects and functionalities are at full blast. The only way to reset it to be 0 is to constantly touch the trigger which only then registers as 0. Can the trigger weight be reset so that its default is 0? It should not affect any of the gestures this is only for trigger weight.",
